# Written by hand: a variant of arch1.bear-enters, one step added after "bear". Not yet run in Cameo.
scenario: The bear is detected twice
id: arch1.bear-seen-twice
kind: alternative
version: 0.1
status: draft
goal: A second detection of the same bear, while it is tracked, changes nothing: no second takeover.
description: Predator Response has no transition on a new detection. The orchestrator must not hand over control again.
author: MBSE Shepherd, to review
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 1, robustness
from: arch1.bear-enters

after bear:
  step bear-again: pasture sends Predator Detected inside tracking perimeter
    note: The camera sees the bear again, still in the tracking perimeter.
    then soi.orch is Predator Defense Active
    then soi.pd is Tracking Predator
    then soi.pd is not Awaiting Control
    then soi.ap is Following Predator
